<title>SOUTH AFRICA: TABLE - Scharrig Ind half yr shr edges up.</title>
<headline>TABLE - Scharrig Ind half yr shr edges up.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Half year ended June 30</p>
<p>			(million rand unless stated)</p>
<p>Shr, (cts)</p>
<p>    - attrib		    6.6	 vs    6.2</p>
<p>    Div, (cts)		  2.0	 vs    2.0</p>
<p>    Attrib income	    12.89	vs   11.75</p>
<p>    Pre-tax		    16.00	vs   12.23</p>
<p>    Tax			   2.60	vs    0.48</p>
<p>    Finance charges	   0.43	vs    0.13 gain</p>
<p>    Turnover		  113.47	vs   82.29</p>
<p>Full name: Scharrig Industrial Holdings Ltd</p>
<p>Div payable: Nov 14</p>
<p>On register: Oct 17</p>
<p>NOTE - The company said it would continue to evaluate potential selective acquisitions with the view to increasing market share and possibly add profitable brand name products to its current product range.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
